OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA generally cloudy but dry day
OL,6,Fis likely. Isolated brighter spells
OL,7,Fpossible through the morning but cloud
OL,8,Fis unlikely to break up. Near average
OL,9,Ftemperatures. Light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FHigh
OL,12,Fpressure continues to dominate, often
OL,13,Fbringing cloudy conditions with light
OL,14,Frain at times but some clearer spells
OL,15,Ftoo. Gentle winds. Temperatures remain
OL,16,Faround normal for the time of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
